  "abstract": "<jats:p>A hybrid-integrated optical transmitter comprising of a SiPh TW-MZM wire-bond with co-designed BW-boosted driver in SiGe BiCMOS is presented. Experimental results demonstrate 336Gb/s/lane PAM-8 optical eye diagrams at 2.47pJ/bit power consumption.</jats:p>",
